<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Revlon FY97 estimate lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Revlon FY97 estimate lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney said it lowered its fiscal year 1997 estimate to $1.10 per share from $1.18 per share.</p>
<p>-- Analyst not available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Revlon shares fell 2-5/8 to 31 in late morning exchange trading.</p>
</text>
